Tardiness or Exceeding time $E_{i}$: $E_{i}=\max(0,L_{i})$ is the time a task stays active after its deadline;

Laxity or Slack time $X_{i}$ : $X_{i}=d_{i}-a_{i}-C_{i}$ is the maximum time a task can be delayed on its activation to complete within its deadline.

